<section class="sub-hero"><div class="sub-hero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/brick-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/brick-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/brick-house.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="shell sub-hero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/">Calculators</a><span class="sep">›</span><span aria-current="page">Percentage Deductible Calculator</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator · runs in your browser</p><h1>Percentage Deductible Calculator for Earthquake, Wind and Hail</h1><p class="lede">A 10% earthquake deductible on a $520,000 home is $52,000. Percentage deductibles change the math on every claim. See yours in dollars and how it affects what a loss pays.</p></div></section><section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="shell"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool" data-tool="deduct">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Percentage deductible calculator</span><i>Earthquake, wind or hail</i></div>
